       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults, which is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision. The OTC limit is 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg at once is also well above the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose. Doses that high raise the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, and they give no added analgesic or anti-inflammatory benefit.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n\n- 400 mg PO four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- 1600 mg total per day, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm it and give the clinical rationale. I'll enter whichever order you choose."
